{
  "key": "factor",
  "aliases": ["factor_research", "f"],
  "version": "2026-08-27.1",
  "capability_owners": {
    "factor": "factor"
  },
  "role_tool_allowlist": {
    "orchestrator": ["update_plan", "topology.dispatch", "factor.register", "factor.list", "factor.mine.llm", "strategy.create_version", "strategy.compose", "backtest.run"],
    "factor": ["factor.register", "factor.compute", "factor.evaluate", "factor.autoEvaluate", "factor.list", "factor.mine.llm", "factor.promote_backtest", "backtest.run"],
    "research": ["factor.register", "factor.compute", "factor.autoEvaluate", "factor.list", "factor.mine.llm", "strategy.create_version", "strategy.compose", "backtest.run"],
    "backtest": ["backtest.run", "backtest.walk_forward"]
  },
  "stall_budget": {
    "tools": [
      "market.readiness",
      "market.resolve_symbol",
      "factor.list",
      "update_plan",
      "mcp:mathjs:evaluate"
    ],
    "key": "tool_fingerprint",
    "max_success": 3,
    "on_exceed": "strip_from_surface"
  },
  "recovery": {
    "after_probe_failure": "continue_without_realtime",
    "forbid_gap_as_final_answer": true
  },
  "completion": {
    "artifacts": [
      {
        "table": "factor_definition",
        "min_rows": 1,
        "research_min_rows": 1,
        "required_fields": ["name", "expression"],
        "scope": "workflow"
      },
      {
        "table": "factor_evaluation",
        "min_rows": 1,
        "research_min_rows": 0,
        "scope": "workflow"
      }
    ],
    "required_tools": [{ "capability": "factor", "min_success": 1 }],
    "answer_schema": {
      "required_sections": ["goal", "evidence", "decision", "risks", "gaps"]
    }
  },
  "checklist_prompt": [
    "1. 工具名必须用点号：factor.register / factor.compute / factor.autoEvaluate / factor.mine.llm（禁止 factor_register 等下划线假名，也禁止把缺口当终答）",
    "2. 本轮至少 factor.register 落库 ≥1 条；参数平铺（name/expr/category/lang），不要包在 arguments 里；project_id 可由 runtime 注入",
    "3. 因子族必须多样化：禁止整轮只有 mom/乖离；至少覆盖 2 类——动量、MACD/KDJ 类技术、量价/买卖量（用 volume / IfPos / Corr）",
    "4. 合法 qlib_expr 示例：EMA(close,12)-EMA(close,26)；Sign(EMA(close,12)-EMA(close,26))；(close-Min(low,9))/(Max(high,9)-Min(low,9)+1e-8)；volume/Mean(volume,20)；Corr(volume,Abs(Delta(close,1)),20)",
    "5. factor.compute → factor.autoEvaluate 闭环；有 composition 后调 backtest.run，再对返回的 backtest_run_id 调 backtest.walk_forward 做 OOS 验证",
    "6. 禁止仅 list 旧因子结案；同类工具连打 ≤3 次后必须写终答"
  ]
}
